# 14. Forbidden Dependency Edges
 
The following must be prevented at the Cargo level.
 `ror-reference → ror-runtime       FORBIDDEN ror-reference → ror-kernel        FORBIDDEN ror-reference → ror-persistence   FORBIDDEN ror-reference → ror-host          FORBIDDEN  ror-core → ror-runtime             FORBIDDEN ror-core → ror-kernel              FORBIDDEN  ror-runtime → ror-reference        FORBIDDEN ror-kernel → ror-runtime           FORBIDDEN  ror-compiler → ror-runtime         FORBIDDEN ` 
The exact compiler/kernel dependency direction may be adjusted if required by implementation mechanics, but the compiler must never receive authority to execute effects.
  
